[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m in the C sources returns only the `DRIVER_H_` include guard. The library holds
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **no global or static state**: both `source` and `dest` are function-local
