[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    324[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    325[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Fixed-seed PRNG (SplitMix64) for property-style inputs.
